TERMS OF USE, RIGHTS & DISCLAIMER:

1. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY & DATA SYSTEM RIGHTS:
All system software rights, algorithmic calibrations, hydraulic models, telemetry integrations,
and database systems belong exclusively to Shivaji University, Kolhapur. 

2. UNAUTHORIZED ACCESS PROHIBITED:
Unauthorized access, modification, automated data scraping, commercialization, sublicensing,
or redistribution of this software, telemetry pipelines, and underlying databases is strictly
prohibited without explicit written authorization from Shivaji University, Kolhapur.

3. MISSION & CITIZEN FLOOD WARNING:
This system is engineered to alert the citizens and administrative stakeholders of Kolhapur
regarding current and projected flood levels across the Panchganga River basin (including
Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Bridge and Rajaram K.T. Weir).

4. RESEARCH AND INFORMATIONAL PURPOSES ONLY:
This platform is provided for scientific research, educational, and public informational purposes only.
Official disaster declarations, emergency directives, and evacuation orders remain the sole
statutory jurisdiction of the District Disaster Management Authority (DDMA), Kolhapur, the
Water Resources Department (WRD), and the Central Water Commission (CWC), Government of India.
Shivaji University, Kolhapur and the project investigators shall not be held liable for any damages
or losses resulting from reliance on the data or predictions provided herein.
